      "message": "\u003e Without it, standard commands like \"eslintfix\" fail for me\n\nCan you provide exact steps how to reproduce the problem?\n\nCan it be, that `WORKSPACE` still mentioned and should be replace with `MODULE.bazel``",
      "revId": "ae356b4c27a5d607d600ffe93609843e2e2d7153",
